<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Furniture To Another Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to ship furniture to another state on the 850 km route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit time usually ranges from 24 to 36 hours, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearances. Our dedicated container trucks travel on National Highway Arterial Corridors with real‑time GPS tracking, ensuring you receive accurate ETAs and timely updates throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required to transport furniture from one city to another?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, the original invoice or packing list, GST registration (if applicable), and a signed e‑Way bill for interstate moves. Our team also prepares a detailed consignment note that includes the declared value for insurance purposes, simplifying the paperwork for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is it safe to ship high‑value furniture fixtures and equipment without additional insurance?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While our trucks are equipped with advanced security features, we strongly recommend opting for the 100% insured package. This IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers the full declared value, protecting you against accidental damage, theft, or loss during the state‑to‑state transfer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my furniture while it’s being transported to another state?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is fitted with satellite GPS that provides live location updates on our customer portal. You can monitor the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint stops, giving you full visibility from origin to destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the cost of shipping furniture to another state compare with using a courier service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Professional movers offer a transparent cost matrix that includes freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, and optional services, often resulting in better value for large or heavy items. Couriers may charge per kilogram and lack specialized handling, which can increase risk and total expense for bulky furniture.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What if my move includes a two‑wheeler or bike along with the furniture?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet includes dedicated two‑wheeler carriers with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. You can transport a bike in the same shipment, and the cost is calculated as an add‑on in the final estimate, ensuring safe and secure movement alongside your furniture.</p>
      </div>
